{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/public-health-advice-from-uk-cmos-during-a-national-power-outage","content_id":"57a847e9-d413-4139-adaa-2cd68606b22e","description":"Scripts containing public health advice from the UK's 4 Chief Medical Officers (CMOs) to be broadcast during a national power outage.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"html","command_paper_number":"","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9607717","isbn":"","title":"Water and sanitation - scripts for broadcast media","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"/government/publications/public-health-advice-from-uk-cmos-during-a-national-power-outage/water-and-sanitation-scripts-for-broadcast-media"},{"attachment_type":"html","command_paper_number":"","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9607718","isbn":"","title":"Food and nutrition - scripts for broadcast media","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"/government/publications/public-health-advice-from-uk-cmos-during-a-national-power-outage/food-and-nutrition-scripts-for-broadcast-media"},{"attachment_type":"html","command_paper_number":"","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9607719","isbn":"","title":"Keeping warm or cool in extreme weather - scripts for broadcast media","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"/government/publications/public-health-advice-from-uk-cmos-during-a-national-power-outage/keeping-warm-or-cool-in-extreme-weather-scripts-for-broadcast-media"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\">\n<p>The 4 UK Chief Medical Officers (<abbr title=\"Chief Medical Officers\">CMOs</abbr>) as independent advisers provide public health advice in emergencies. To help preparations for the very unlikely event of a national power outage (a total power outage affecting the whole of Great Britain), they have developed scripts containing health advice that would be given to the public in this scenario.</p>\n\n<p>In a national power outage, sharing accurate advice with the public would be challenging because phone, internet and television services would be disrupted. For this reason, these emergency communications would be limited to radio broadcasts.</p>\n\n<p>We have published the scripts here in the interests of transparency. The following important health topics are covered:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>water and sanitation</li>\n  <li>food and nutrition</li>\n  <li>keeping warm or cool in extreme weather</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>These are not government policy - they have been developed by the 4 UK <abbr title=\"Chief Medical Officers\">CMOs</abbr> as independent health advisers, with valuable input from the UK Health Security Agency (UKHSA) and collaboration across the 4 nations and their respective public health agencies.</p>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2025-12-16T16:00:00Z"}],"document_type_label":"Independent report","emphasised_organisations":["7cd6bf12-bbe9-4118-8523-f927b0442156"],"featured_attachments":["9607717","9607718","9607719"],"first_public_at":"2025-12-16T16:00:00.000+00:00","political":false,"tags":{"browse_pages":[]}},"document_type":"independent_report","first_published_at":"2025-12-16T16:00:00+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/publications/public-health-advice-from-uk-cmos-during-a-national-power-outage","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/publications/public-health-advice-from-uk-cmos-during-a-national-power-outage","base_path":"/government/publications/public-health-advice-from-uk-cmos-during-a-national-power-outage","content_id":"57a847e9-d413-4139-adaa-2cd68606b22e","document_type":"independent_report","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2025-12-16T16:00:00Z","schema_name":"publication","title":"Public health advice from UK CMOs during a national power outage","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/public-health-advic